Subject: [PATCH] wifi: mt76: mt7996: finish cleanup after truncated txfree

Based on OpenWRT-fanboy/OpenW1700k commit
23df1d78c6476d4a301ecd56aab65f4c6be86542 (0005 txfree overrun).

Keep the existing WARN_ON_ONCE diagnostic. Leave the descriptor loop on a
truncated event so the already completed prefix still reaches the existing
TX wake, worker scheduling and free_list consumption. Do not change token
ownership or reclaim tokens whose completion was never reported.

--- a/mt7996/mac.c
+++ b/mt7996/mac.c
@@ -1402,7 +1402,7 @@
 		u8 i;
 
 		if (WARN_ON_ONCE((void *)cur_info >= end))
-			return;
+			break;
 		/* 1'b1: new wcid pair.
 		 * 1'b0: msdu_id with the same 'wcid pair' as above.
 		 */
